orded for internal training purposes? Your data will never be shared with third parties.",\n    "intent": "doGreetingCall"\n}'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "In less than 200 characters: Actually, I'm not interested in the job anymore. Thank you."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n    "msg": "Thank you for letting me know. If you change your mind or need any assistance in the future, feel free to reach out. Goodbye!",\n    "intent": "endCall"\n}'}]
